Subject: Repeated measures (LME)
Message-ID: <0otRf0-UwTU.8kRoWfMlBgAJ@braingraph-help.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/braingraph-help/c/0otRf0-UwTU/m/8kRoWfMlBgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dear Chris,

Thanks again for this wonderful tool.

I have longitudinal data (unabalanced design), and was wondering if/when you are planning to incorperate the LME function into brainGraph (for NBS and graph measures [MTPC]).
Just so I can determine whether I should wait, or look for other packages. If it's the latter, do you have any recommendations?

Many thanks in advance.

Best wishes, Femke

From udadcb4fd6a01f8d1 at groups.google.com  Wed Mar 17 16:47:24 2021
From: udadcb4fd6a01f8d1 at groups.google.com (Chris Watson)
Date: Wed, 17 Mar 2021 16:47:24 +0000
Subject: Re: [brainGraph-help] Repeated measures (LME)
Message-ID: <0otRf0-UwTU.sGZsopcoBgAJ@braingraph-help.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <0otRf0-UwTU.8kRoWfMlBgAJ@braingraph-help.groups.google.com>
